@startuml
title State Machine Diagram - Order Lifecycle (FR-02)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> CREATED : createOrderPost()
CREATED --> CONFIRMED : confirmOrder()\nstock -qty (exactly once)
CONFIRMED --> PICKING : advanceOrder(id, "PICKING")
PICKING --> SHIPPED : createShipment()
SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : advanceOrder(id, "DELIVERED")
CREATED --> CANCELLED : cancelOrder()\nno restock (nothing reserved)
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancelOrder()\nrestock +qty (exactly once)
PICKING --> PICKING : cancelOrder()\nrejected (409)
DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
note right of CONFIRMED
  Cancel is idempotent:
  restock happens exactly once
end note
@enduml
